  "body": "### What should we add?\n\nWith the `AdaptVQE` algorithm being migrated to Terra (https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-terra/pull/7930), we should add a factory class to Nature which can leverage this algorithm in combination with the at-runtime constructed UCC ansatz. The same could be done for the UVCC case.",
